# OrangeFox recovery init additions for Infinix X6870 (MT6878)
#
# The display stack (mediatek-drm + nt37703a panel) is loaded by TWRP from the
# stock vendor_boot ramdisk (/lib/modules/modules.load.recovery). Touch drivers
# are NOT in vendor_boot - the vendor keeps them in /odm_dlkm, so they are
# bundled in this ramdisk instead.
#
# Do NOT insmod the touch modules here. adaptive_ts needs tnek, opsMediator and
# mtk_disp_notify (see the holders column in /proc/modules), which are only
# inserted later by TWRP's module loader. Both modules are listed at the end of
# TW_LOAD_VENDOR_MODULES instead, which libmodprobe resolves at Process_Fstab()
# time - after tnek (line 187) and opsMediator (line 73), before gui_init().

on init
    setprop sys.usb.configfs 1
    setprop sys.usb.controller "11201000.usb0"
